# Intentionally no VITE_API_URL.
#
# Leaving it unset makes the client call /api on its own origin, which
# vercel.json rewrites to Railway. Setting it back to
# https://gitglobe-api-production.up.railway.app is what caused the outage this
# replaced: Jio answers REFUSED for the entire up.railway.app zone, so every
# visitor on India's largest ISP got "Load failed" and no request ever left the
# device. It looks fine from any network whose resolver answers for the zone,
# which is why it survived so long.
#
# Vite inlines this at build time, so a value set here or in Vercel's Project
# Settings -> Environment Variables wins over the default in src/api.ts. If the
# proxy ever appears to be ignored in production, check there first.
